{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-11-07 06:32:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE CONSTRUCTION CLOUD POWERED BY MICROSOFT AZURE LAUNCHES AT TRIMBLE DIMENSIONS+ CONFERENCE', 'text': "CONSTRUCTION-FOCUSED CLOUD PLATFORM IS THE NEW BACKBONE OF TRIMBLE CONSTRUCTION ONE,\xa0 ENABLING PROJECT TEAMS TO BETTER DESIGN, CONSTRUCT, OPERATE AND MANAGE PROJECTS LAS VEGAS , NOV. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF TRIMBLE CONSTRUCTION CLOUD POWERED BY MICROSOFT AZURE, AN INDUSTRY CLOUD TO STREAMLINE CONSTRUCTION PROJECTS. TRIMBLE CONSTRUCTION CLOUD WAS DEVELOPED AS PART OF TRIMBLE'S COLLABORATION WITH MICROSOFT TO ADVANCE TECHNOLOGY ADOPTION AND ACCELERATE THE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION OF THE CONSTRUCTION, AGRICULTURE AND TRANSPORTATION INDUSTRIES."}{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-11-07 06:31:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE AND HP COLLABORATE TO EXPLORE THE USE OF ROBOTIC TECHNOLOGY FOR AUTONOMOUS INDOOR CONSTRUCTION LAYOUT', 'text': "LAS VEGAS , NOV. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) AND HP ARE COLLABORATING ON THE INTEGRATION OF TRIMBLE'S LATEST ROBOTIC TOTAL STATION WITH HP'S NEW SITEPRINT ROBOTIC LAYOUT SOLUTION. THE SOLUTION FOCUSES ON TRANSFORMING THE LAYOUT PROCESS FOR INDOOR CONSTRUCTION PROJECTS."}{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-11-07 06:30:00', 'title': 'EXYN TECHNOLOGIES AND TRIMBLE COLLABORATE ON A PROOF OF CONCEPT FOR A FULLY AUTONOMOUS SURVEYING SOLUTION FOR CONSTRUCTION', 'text': "TOGETHER EXYN AND TRIMBLE DEMONSTRATE A GROUNDBREAKING SOLUTION TO INCREASE EFFICIENCY\xa0 AND SAFETY ACROSS COMPLEX GNSS-DENIED CONSTRUCTION ENVIRONMENTS\xa0 LAS VEGAS , NOV. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) AND EXYN TECHNOLOGIES, A PIONEER IN MULTI-PLATFORM ROBOTIC AUTONOMY FOR COMPLEX, GPS-DENIED ENVIRONMENTS, ANNOUNCED TODAY A STRATEGIC COLLABORATION TO EXPLORE THE USE OF AUTONOMOUS CONSTRUCTION SURVEYING TECHNOLOGY. THE SOLUTION WILL INTEGRATE BOSTON DYNAMICS' SPOT®\xa0ROBOT, THE EXYNPAK™ POWERED BY EXYNAI™ AND THE TRIMBLE® X7 TOTAL STATION."}